              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eishooyo oltung'ani obo pesho, ore ake sii neitoki aponaa e enkarsisisho; ore olikae neibok ina naishiakino neishooyo, nenyamalu oleng te yieunoto sapuk.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.11.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
